# <type>(<scope>): <subject>          <- max 72 chars, imperative, no trailing dot
#
# <body>                              <- what and why, not how. wrap at 100.
#
# <footer>                            <- Closes #12 / BREAKING CHANGE: ...
#
# --- types --------------------------------------------------------------
#   feat      new capability
#   fix       bug fix
#   docs      documentation only
#   refactor  neither fixes a bug nor adds a feature
#   perf      performance
#   test      tests only
#   build     build system, dependencies
#   ci        CI configuration
#   chore     anything else that touches no source
#   revert    reverts a previous commit
#
# --- scopes -------------------------------------------------------------
#   desktop   apps/desktop              core    libs/core/kernel
#   mobile    apps/mobile               domain  libs/core/kernel/domain
#   landing   apps/landing              ui      libs/ui/components
#   protocol  libs/core/protocol        sdk     libs/plugin/sdk-ts
#   docs      everything else in docs/  vault   vault format / parser
#   ci  deps  repo
#
# --- examples -----------------------------------------------------------
#   feat(domain): resolve wikilinks by name with priority rules
#   fix(protocol): keep note:// links untouched on rename
#   feat(domain)!: drop path-based note identity
#
# A breaking change is marked either with ! after the scope or with a
# BREAKING CHANGE: footer.
